project title and bullet points:
ApexStore – Commercial Full-Stack E-Commerce Platform

Tech Stack: Python, Django, Django REST Framework, React.js, Tailwind CSS, SQLite, Token Auth

Designed normalized relational database schemas with Django ORM, handling multi-user cart isolation and order management.

Implemented atomic database transactions (@transaction.atomic) for concurrent stock deduction and price-snapshot preservation during checkout.

Developed secure REST APIs featuring token-based authentication, dynamic Q-object catalog search, and multi-parameter price sorting.

Built a responsive, multi-page client application with React Router v6, custom drawer modals, live quantity modification, and persistent browser storage.



